# Not listed: wharf-runs/node/* (bin/yard-node's docstring) — only a Mac that drives a yard node
# has them, so naming them here would report them missing on every other Mac.
# Nor wharf-runs/nodes/<NAME>/* and wharf-runs/tofu/<NAME>/ (the same docstring): a named node's,
# on the one Mac that buys and drives it. A node folder's `orca-pair` is orca-host's: optional, as
# a Mac with no node has no folder.
# Not listed: wharf-runs/features, an optional key (README): absent, no host meets a need.
# Nor wharf-runs/queue-mode (absent: every host with a home claims) or wharf-runs/power (absent: only the core's
